:"<span>needs English for their job.</span>"},{"id":7165,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>really wants to learn.</span>"}]},{"id":4693,"num":"4","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>Sarah says that the worst student is someone who...</div>","choices":[{"id":7166,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>doesn't pay attention.</span>"},{"id":7167,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>is not interested in learning. </span>"},{"id":7168,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>doesn't go to all the lessons. </span>"}]},{"id":4694,"num":"5","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>Sarah ...</div>","choices":[{"id":7169,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>really likes languages.</span>"},{"id":7170,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>teaches different languages. </span>"},{"id":7171,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>teaches in a very nice school. </span>"}]},{"id":4695,"num":"6","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>Sarah ...</div>","choices":[{"id":7172,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>comes from an English family. </span>"},{"id":7173,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>considers herself a native English speaker. </span>"},{"id":7174,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>was born in England. </span>"}]},{"id":4696,"num":"7","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>The way Sarah learned most English was...</div>","choices":[{"id":7175,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>by reading a lot. </span>"},{"id":7176,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>by speaking with native friends. </span>"},{"id":7177,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>by studying lists of words. </span>"}]},{"id":4697,"num":"8","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>Sarah says that she ...</div>","choices":[{"id":7178,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>speaks British English. </span>"},{"id":7179,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>speaks a more American English. </span>"},{"id":7180,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>loves American English. </span>"}]}]}]}